  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/652/652-11.htm",
  "statuteText": "652:11 Party. –\n\n\"Party\" shall mean any political organization which at the preceding state general election received at least 4 percent of the total number of votes cast for any one of the following: the office of governor or the offices of United States senators."
}
